    "sample": "9 lumbar vertebra-disc-vertebra segments (L1-L2 x3, L2-L3 x3, L3-L4 x3) from 7 spines; analysed n 6-9 per DOF; human cadaveric lumbar discs (donor weight 84.5 (20.8) kg), Thompson grade 1 (2), 3 (5), 4 (1), 5 (1)",
    "age": "mean (SD) 41.9 (18.4) y, range 16-60",
    "sex": "5 M, 2 F (donors)",
